          <characteristics>
            <characteristic name="Description" typeId="21befb24-fc85-4f52-a745-64b2e48f8228">A unit with Ram Jets can use them once per turn in either the Movement phase or the assault phase. They cannot use Ram Jets in both phases in the same turn. 


Movement Phase - Add D6 to your movement. 


Assault phase - You can reroll one of your dice when determining charge distance.</characteristic>
